{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Then both of them shall die.</b> Rashi explained: 'also' — to include those who come after them. And he said that if a man lay with her after her verdict was completed, he is liable the death penalty. For one might have thought: she is considered as good as dead, and he would not be liable on her account — therefore גם ('also') teaches us."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:16.769014256Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}